INSERT INTO "knowledge_chunks" ("id", "document_id", "chunk_index", "content", "embedding", "token_count", "created_at") VALUES ('9931658d-86ef-4e27-9c27-4bc4dfaba5a1', '0ed28c99-8bd5-49a4-9938-3cbb09acf372', 0, 'Rayven Strategic Communications (RayvenSC) is a premier narrative architecture firm
headquartered in Abuja, Nigeria. It is a remote-first strategic communications firm
serving clients across Africa and global markets.

RayvenSC sits at the intersection of strategy, narrative, and human understanding.
The firm was built to solve a specific problem: the gap between what an organisation says
and what the world actually understands. That gap is not closed with more content, louder
messaging, or bigger budgets — it is closed with context.

RayvenSC works with corporations, government bodies, NGOs, and growth-stage brands across
Africa and beyond — helping them communicate with the cultural intelligence and strategic
intent needed to influence the audiences that matter most.

