INSERT INTO "knowledge_chunks" ("id", "document_id", "chunk_index", "content", "embedding", "token_count", "created_at") VALUES ('fef6c269-115f-417c-837f-692add61b1b1', 'bfe1b30f-7785-4dcc-bd3b-cc44c61efd81', 0, 'Service: Brand Strategy & Identity

Most brands communicate. Few are truly understood. We build the narrative architecture that
closes that gap.

What this includes:
- Brand positioning
- Brand architecture
- Messaging systems
- Identity direction

The problem we solve: Campaigns that generate impressions but not conviction. Messaging that is
consistent but not compelling. Brands that are recognised but not respected.

Our approach: Building the underlying narrative architecture that makes all communications more
