INSERT INTO "knowledge_chunks" ("id", "document_id", "chunk_index", "content", "embedding", "token_count", "created_at") VALUES ('f747e50e-41ea-4ac8-ac1e-5223461fd46e', '044659cc-e9a5-41dc-9f56-a0a444fe9521', 0, 'Service: Strategic Communications & PR

In high-stakes environments, the right message at the right moment is everything.

What this includes:
- Corporate communications
- Media strategy
- Reputation management
- Public relations
- Crisis communications (proactive preparedness and reactive rapid-response)

RayvenSC doesn''t just manage press — they build the underlying narrative architecture that
makes all communications more effective.

Note: RayvenSC can also serve as a strategic layer on top of existing in-house communications
