INSERT INTO "knowledge_chunks" ("id", "document_id", "chunk_index", "content", "embedding", "token_count", "created_at") VALUES ('f6656155-64d0-4c22-ae54-c13a7aeb2d8e', '0d6199c7-629c-47d9-9672-fef3a7e87faa', 0, 'How engagements with RayvenSC work:

Timeline: Depends on scope. A brand communications audit can take 2–4 weeks. A full brand
strategy and narrative development typically runs 6–12 weeks. Scope is defined clearly before
any engagement begins.

Getting started: Contact RayvenSC via hello@rayvensc.com or the contact form at rayvensc.com/contact.
A discovery call will be scheduled to understand the situation and recommend the right approach.

